  "scene": {
    "id": "distribute-pilot2",
    "language": "All right. Yeah, it felt pretty good. You, like, can't pa- you can't pass it into space, right? Like, if you pass it, like, in between a gap... Yeah. Okay (laughs). Gotcha. Okay. (exhales) All right. In this round, I see that, uh, defender one is very close to me, which makes me think I'm not gonna be able to pass the ball forward, so I'm gonna try to look to pass to the sides. Uh, defender two is very close to the right winger, so he's not very open. So, I'm gonna try to pass to the left winger because he has the most space. [0]So,[1] I'm gonna take the ball back so that I have more space for my defender, and then I'm gonna pass to the left winger. [2]As[3] the ball goes to the left winger, I wanna make sure that he has someone to pass to, so I'm gonna show into the gap between defender one and defender three. This is gonna make him have an option to pass to. [4][5]As the left winger's received the ball, I've showed into the gap so that he has an angle to pass to that defender three can't block.",
